+---
+id: task-002-add-rental-equipment-availability-query
+type: task
+title: "Add rental equipment availability query"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Add `availability(query)` to the rental service. `query` contains UTC-midnight, whole-day `start`
+and `end` timestamps and an optional `kind` (`board` or `sail`). The operation returns the sorted
+equipment IDs matching the requested kind, or all kinds when omitted, which have no overlapping
+booking for the entire requested period. Invalid periods and invalid kinds must be rejected using
+the service's existing validation rules.
